# yaml-language-server: $schema=https://aka.ms/winget-manifest.defaultLocale.1.6.0.schema.json
PackageIdentifier: getSigit.siGitCode
PackageVersion: @VERSION@
PackageLocale: en-US
Publisher: getSigit
PublisherUrl: https://sigit.si/
PublisherSupportUrl: https://github.com/@REPO@/issues
PackageName: siGit Code
PackageUrl: https://sigit.si/code
License: Apache-2.0
LicenseUrl: https://github.com/@REPO@/blob/main/LICENSE
Copyright: Copyright 2026 Seto Elkahfi, trading as siGit Code & Deploy
ShortDescription: A modular local inference LLM coding agent. Core component of siGit Factory.
Description: |-
  siGit Code is a modular local inference LLM coding agent and the core
  component of siGit Factory. It runs on your machine by default, with
  optional cloud inference and remote automation when you choose them.
  No API key is required to start; the on-device path needs none at all.

  It works two ways from the same binary. Zed and other ACP-compatible
  editors start it over stdio and talk the Agent Client Protocol to it. Run
  it from a terminal and you get an interactive chat UI instead. On Windows
  it speaks ACP; the full-screen terminal UI is Unix-only.

  Inference runs on-device against a GGUF model, or against siGit Code Cloud
  or any OpenAI-compatible endpoint you point it at.
Moniker: sigit
